	(text "|IA| > 410 A (band 382-441 A, own REF3030E + 0.1 % network, CM-cancelling) AND FB = closed AND\nDIAG = valid -> HOLD1. Test injection 86.6 k from A_TST_T (side A) / A_TST_TD (side B): shifts the threshold\nby 459 A, so a healthy side trips at 0 A under TEST only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 194.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5a690e73-8570-5f01-ba99-18557868f8f1")
	)
	(text "Linear +/-500 A, clip +/-640 A (OC trip 202 A, SC trip 405 A inside). 10 ohm + 10 nF input\nfilter (SBASA11B Fig 8-2). HGND on the shunt's X- bolt by its own trace. Fail-safe out = -2.57 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 325.056 99.184 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5b6e6cbd-7327-546c-9fed-6660898a850e")
	)
	(text "VA - BUS-SIDE VOLTAGE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "61e0f3e9-9ed4-53c8-86f3-de823ff78f16")
	)
	(text "6 x TNPV1206 1.00 M (167 V each at 1000 V) + 4.99 k: 1 V = 1203 V, clip 1504 V. 4.7 nF: lag\n<= 27 us incl. AMC3330. Out: VAX_P/N (+/-2 V on 1.44 V, PORT contract). HGND = P1_BUS-."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 169.528 104.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "77145475-ce96-5584-8d8e-f7f96963714a")
	)
	(text "RB1 = OC1 OR hold high-side output present (100 k / 15 k): at rest RB1 = 1 means a stuck channel 1.\nRB2 = OC2. PV-PORT sums them onto the ID line (board_io); firmware reads RB1 + RB2 against the\nmeasured current in operation and through the proof-test windows at start."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 355.096 362.644 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8599df0b-2274-5ced-8bfd-d9c03f933f31")
	)
	(text "100 k / 15 k -> Schmitt buffer T (ch1 side A). T -> 47 k / 22 uF -> T_d (ch1 side B). One-shots\n(3.3 uF / 47 k) of T -> T2A (ch2 side A) and of T_d -> T2B (ch2 side B). No single fault trips both\nchannels for longer than one one-shot. Firmware runs it at every start, contactor open and closed\n(report sec. 7.4: windows, what it finds and what it does not)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 370.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9cdc080d-d752-5806-a697-a56e96090258")
	)
	(text "PROOF-TEST INJECTION (DO_SPARE = TEST)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 296.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bd886bce-4ebc-5669-8947-468af952bd56")
	)
	(text "|IA| > 410 A (band 382-441 A, own REF3030E + 0.1 % network, CM-cancelling) AND FB = closed AND\nDIAG = valid -> HOLD2. Test injection 86.6 k from A_TST_T2A (side A) / A_TST_T2B (side B): shifts the threshold\nby 459 A, so a healthy side trips at 0 A under TEST only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 283.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e95b54b1-96e8-569d-839d-73b0e239707f")
	)
	(text "6 x TNPV1206 1.00 M (167 V each at 1000 V) + 4.99 k: 1 V = 1203 V, clip 1504 V. 4.7 nF: lag\n<= 27 us incl. AMC3330. Out: VA_P/N (+/-2 V on 1.44 V, PORT contract). HGND = P1_BUS-."
